WEBVTT

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:11.320
Welcome back.

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:14.070
Ultranate?!
But, that's impossible!

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:40.180
All orbital attack satellites
have been destroyed, sir.

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:44.020
Excellent. Proceed to
stage 3 of the operation.

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:46.820
Aye, sir.
Proceeding to stage 3.

00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:49.980
Lagu energy,
switch to line A!

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:51.990
Open transmission antennas!

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:15.550
Transmission antennas, open!

00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:20.010
Adjusting angles.
Unit 1, plus 0.8 Unit 2...

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:23.460
Just what are you trying to do?

00:01:23.940 --> 00:01:25.230
You want to know?

00:01:25.740 --> 00:01:27.320
Adjustment, complete.

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:27.600
Right.

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:30.280
Mr. Hargen?

00:01:31.530 --> 00:01:34.690
Commence transmission
of Lagu energy.

00:01:59.630 --> 00:02:02.260
Everything about you is everything to me.

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:05.340
I don't want to hold back anymore!

00:02:05.340 --> 00:02:10.350
I remember. We got G.D.

00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:13.060
Let's follow the course where our curiosity leads...

00:02:13.060 --> 00:02:15.980
...and I know a wondrous power will be born.

00:02:15.980 --> 00:02:21.070
Silent City. We're Salvagers.

00:02:21.070 --> 00:02:23.900
Let's go out sometime and try to find...

00:02:23.900 --> 00:02:26.910
...the skyscrapers in the sunken cities below.

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:31.490
Don't be afraid. Come together.

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:36.830
As the sun shines down upon us...

00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:42.260
...now, let's try to recover...

00:02:43.050 --> 00:02:47.340
...everything that's been lost!

00:02:47.720 --> 00:02:53.470
Let's journey beyond time!

00:02:53.470 --> 00:03:00.940
I miss you! I want to take it to you!

00:03:00.940 --> 00:03:04.240
I don't want you to forget about me.

00:03:04.240 --> 00:03:09.200
I take you! Because there is...

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:15.200
...a shining world that no one's ever seen!

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:18.170
Let it go!

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:23.340
Forever...

00:03:43.140 --> 00:03:45.990
Now, then, will you please
hand over the data disc?

00:03:46.340 --> 00:03:48.840
We don't have time to
be talking about that!

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:51.370
Aren't you going to do anything
about that battleship of his?!

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:54.460
The military has thrown together a space battle fleet

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:57.620
that's preparing to scramble to destroy the battleship.

00:03:57.840 --> 00:04:01.930
Destroy...?! Then what
about Aika and Rion?!

00:04:01.930 --> 00:04:03.340
Are you just
leaving them to die?!

00:04:03.850 --> 00:04:07.250
I don't recall guaranteeing
your lives on this mission.

00:04:07.490 --> 00:04:08.930
What did you say...?!

00:04:11.340 --> 00:04:14.250
Wait!
Please, give us a chance!

00:04:14.380 --> 00:04:18.090
Please! l'll take care of
that ship even if I die doing it!

00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:21.810
So, please!
Give us one more chance!

00:04:29.350 --> 00:04:32.750
Lagu is normally located at various
points deep within the Earth.

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:35.860
It moves freely, carried in
the mantle's convection currents.

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:39.940
The great disaster that occurred
20 years ago happened when...

00:04:39.940 --> 00:04:43.240
...by accident, a great deal of
Lagu surfaced simultaneously.

00:04:43.240 --> 00:04:47.920
My plan is to beam Lagu
energy down from orbit...

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:52.180
...and cause the Lagu in the Earth
to all simultaneously surface.

00:04:52.780 --> 00:04:55.690
In short, my aim is to
artificially create an earthquake...

00:04:55.690 --> 00:05:00.610
...hundreds of times more powerful than the one that struck 20 years ago.

00:05:01.050 --> 00:05:02.440
But, if you do that...!

00:05:03.020 --> 00:05:08.660
The civilization of those foolish
apes shall return to nothingness.

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:12.620
Along with the apes
themselves, of course.

00:05:14.230 --> 00:05:17.570
If... If you do that,
you won't survive either!

00:05:17.570 --> 00:05:20.960
The environment wouldn't
support human life after that!

00:05:21.740 --> 00:05:26.220
Have no fear. The environment
will be regenerated.

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:29.140
That is the aim of this project.

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:31.640
Regenerated...?

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:35.400
Yes. That's why this ship also
carries the DNA sets of...

00:05:35.400 --> 00:05:39.610
...several thousand species
of animals and plants.

00:05:40.250 --> 00:05:43.230
The earth and seas
shall be reconstructed.

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:45.820
A new ecosystem will form.

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:49.450
And then we shall
descend to the new Earth.

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:53.440
We shall build an ideal
human civilization. A Utopia!

00:05:55.300 --> 00:05:56.930
Utopia...?

00:05:56.930 --> 00:05:59.210
And, by any chance...?

00:05:59.410 --> 00:06:04.460
As you've guessed,
the ones to build Utopia...

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:08.380
...shall be me and the
women aboard this ship!

00:06:10.080 --> 00:06:11.470
By the way, Miss...

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:13.470
How about it?

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:15.200
Would you be interested in...

00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:18.520
...passing on my genetic
material to a new generation?

00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:23.480
Absolutely NOT!

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:26.280
What is with you?!
No matter how you say it...

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:30.660
...all you're after is to create a
harem you can have all to yourself!

00:06:31.470 --> 00:06:32.640
Take her away!

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:33.650
Sir!

00:06:34.810 --> 00:06:38.080
Why, you...! You can't
make me do what you want!

00:06:38.320 --> 00:06:40.540
You gold-buttoned girly man!

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:42.340
You curly-haired pervert!

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:47.270
And where'd you get that
stupid uniform?! You drag!!

00:06:59.930 --> 00:07:03.960
I have to pay you
back for LAST TIME!

00:07:32.460 --> 00:07:35.360
I've gotta do something.
I've gotta do something.

00:07:35.360 --> 00:07:38.600
I've gotta warn Daddy
and Aika somehow.

00:07:38.780 --> 00:07:40.560
Shut up!
Don't talk, just walk!

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:43.960
Okay, now stay
here and keep quiet.

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:03.530
Rion! Rion, is that you?!

00:08:03.530 --> 00:08:06.440
But why are you wearing...?!
Oh, no. Come on...

00:08:06.440 --> 00:08:09.920
Rion, are you all right?
Rion! Rion, wake up!

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:12.800
Wow, you sound
just like Aika...

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:17.260
Aika! Aika, is that really you?!

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:20.620
It is. Oh, Rion,
l'm sorry I took so long.

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:25.810
I'm so happy...
You really came back for me?

00:08:26.090 --> 00:08:28.440
What do you mean?
Of course I did!

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:31.780
You're my precious
partner, aren't you?

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:35.310
Forgive me. If I hadn't messed up,
this wouldn't have happened to you.

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:38.500
No! Don't say that!
Don't say that!

00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:42.680
I'm just happy that
you came back for me!

00:08:42.680 --> 00:08:43.840
Rion...

00:08:43.840 --> 00:08:45.290
Aika!

00:08:47.410 --> 00:08:49.070
Aika, your arm!

00:08:49.070 --> 00:08:49.220
It's all right.
Just a little scrape, that's all.
Aika, your arm!

00:08:49.220 --> 00:08:52.170
It's all right.
Just a little scrape, that's all.

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:52.300
You mean...
It's all right.
Just a little scrape, that's all.

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:53.410
You mean...

00:08:53.410 --> 00:08:57.010
Now that l've found you in one
piece, let's get out of here!

00:08:59.370 --> 00:09:02.250
So, that's what
Prof. Hargen is up to...

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:06.290
Yeah, unless we do something,
Earth's in big trouble.

00:09:06.290 --> 00:09:06.980
That's why l...!

00:09:07.920 --> 00:09:12.400
I know, but first let's
concentrate on escaping.

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:14.610
Okay? Follow me.

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:16.820
But...! Aika!

00:09:21.880 --> 00:09:22.950
Sorry.

00:09:26.090 --> 00:09:28.210
Where's the escape pod?!
Show us!

00:09:42.960 --> 00:09:44.600
M-Miss Nena!

00:10:08.810 --> 00:10:12.420
Wh-What is she?! A cyborg?

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:22.570
Aika!

00:10:22.570 --> 00:10:23.640
Rion!

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:27.980
You've really got
some guts, don't you?

00:10:32.260 --> 00:10:33.020
Aika!

00:10:39.690 --> 00:10:42.760
Hey, you! What are
you doing to Aika?!

00:10:57.180 --> 00:11:00.680
Aren't you going to
ask for help? What's wrong, hm?

00:11:10.570 --> 00:11:11.480
What?!

00:11:29.280 --> 00:11:31.960
No way... Aika...

00:11:32.980 --> 00:11:38.380
Rion, if I could have, I never
would've let you see me like this.

00:11:39.380 --> 00:11:42.640
Forgive me for hiding
this from you till now.

00:11:42.900 --> 00:11:45.720
It's... It's...

00:11:45.720 --> 00:11:49.680
Cool! That is so just
so totally cool! Aika!

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:54.810
Too cool! So, how do you
transform?! You lucky stiff!

00:11:54.810 --> 00:11:57.800
It's wonderful!
Like something out of anime!

00:11:57.800 --> 00:11:59.020
Hey...

00:11:59.020 --> 00:12:01.760
Why didn't you ever tell me
about something this great?

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:03.890
People can be so mean!
Even you, Aika.

00:12:03.890 --> 00:12:04.700
Um, well...

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:07.520
So, how does it work?

00:12:07.520 --> 00:12:10.960
Hey! Quit ignoring me!

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:21.700
Small craft approaching!

00:12:21.700 --> 00:12:22.540
What?

00:12:22.540 --> 00:12:25.430
I think it's a national
space force vessel.

00:12:26.010 --> 00:12:27.260
Orders, sir?

00:12:27.440 --> 00:12:28.680
We've no time to waste.

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:30.810
Draw it in,
then destroy it with one shot.

00:12:33.370 --> 00:12:37.210
Strange, they must've noticed us,
but they're doing nothing.

00:12:37.210 --> 00:12:38.660
Look sharp, Bandra!

00:12:38.660 --> 00:12:39.150
Right.

00:13:07.380 --> 00:13:09.930
Craft has collided
with antenna #3!

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:12.310
Antenna heavily damaged!
Nonfunctional!

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:14.760
Transmission output
down by 25%!

00:13:14.760 --> 00:13:15.480
What?!

00:13:16.160 --> 00:13:18.480
Compensate the output loss
with the remaining 3 antennas!

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:21.610
But, sir! That'll put
too high a load on them!

00:13:21.920 --> 00:13:24.820
It's all right! lt'll still
be within their specifications!

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:27.760
All right! We'll transfer
inside there, now.

00:13:27.760 --> 00:13:29.650
Bandra, take us over
to the nearest hatch!

00:13:29.650 --> 00:13:30.290
Gotcha!

00:13:30.880 --> 00:13:34.020
The vessel has
docked with us! Hatch #7!

00:13:34.020 --> 00:13:36.040
Get an armed squad down there!

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:36.710
Aye, aye!

00:13:44.820 --> 00:13:47.970
Hey, cut it out!
I said cut it out!

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:52.140
What's the big idea?!

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:54.890
You were in the way!
Quit daydreaming!

00:13:55.450 --> 00:13:58.460
What's the big idea,
forcing me to come with you?!

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:00.860
Hey! Are you listening to me?!

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:02.260
Here.

00:14:03.880 --> 00:14:05.490
Watch your back.

00:14:05.490 --> 00:14:07.410
Right.

00:14:08.560 --> 00:14:10.160
Gusto, hurry!

00:14:10.380 --> 00:14:11.450
Right!

00:14:13.180 --> 00:14:14.080
Now, look...

00:14:14.320 --> 00:14:16.940
Gusto, you handle
setting the explosives.

00:14:16.940 --> 00:14:18.610
I'll look for Rion and Aika!

00:14:18.610 --> 00:14:20.220
Sure! Later!

00:14:21.260 --> 00:14:24.050
Sorry, but would you
show me the way, Maypia?

00:14:26.820 --> 00:14:30.550
Sure, sure. I'll show you.
My pleasure. Right.

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:32.400
For crying out loud...

00:14:40.780 --> 00:14:43.610
Come on, let's use this chance
to get to the escape pods!

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:50.280
You won't get away!

00:14:50.760 --> 00:14:52.780
Reprogramming, complete.

00:14:53.140 --> 00:14:56.960
Antenna load is still
within spec. It's working.

00:14:56.960 --> 00:14:59.000
Schedule loss?

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:01.250
At most, 13% behind.

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:03.000
Excellent.

00:15:03.990 --> 00:15:05.320
Mr. Hargen.

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:07.220
Now what?

00:15:07.810 --> 00:15:10.050
Fighting has
broken out in Area 58.

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:13.120
The ship is taking
considerable damage.

00:15:13.400 --> 00:15:15.140
Route the video over here.

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:19.210
Wha...?!

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:22.290
Show me the
lab section room!

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:24.070
Lab section room, on screen.

00:15:25.220 --> 00:15:26.400
When did...?!

00:15:28.640 --> 00:15:30.280
Carry on with the plan!

00:15:30.560 --> 00:15:31.240
Aye, sir!

00:15:32.180 --> 00:15:33.050
Are they here?

00:15:33.050 --> 00:15:34.410
No!

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:37.740
All right, you guys
head for Area 69.

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:39.040
Aye, aye!

00:15:51.620 --> 00:15:54.080
There! Huh? What the hell...?

00:15:54.080 --> 00:15:55.140
What?

00:15:55.960 --> 00:15:57.610
What's wrong?
Have you found them?

00:15:57.610 --> 00:15:59.560
Well, yeah,
l've found them, but...

00:16:00.300 --> 00:16:02.230
What the hell is going on here?

00:16:03.240 --> 00:16:05.090
You know where it is?

00:16:05.090 --> 00:16:06.100
Yeah.

00:16:06.100 --> 00:16:07.190
All right, let's go!

00:16:07.850 --> 00:16:08.920
Freeze!

00:16:10.260 --> 00:16:11.780
All right, hands up!

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:27.090
It can't be!

00:16:28.330 --> 00:16:32.820
Why?! My Ultranate is supposed
to be far superior to yours!

00:16:32.820 --> 00:16:33.840
But, then why...?

00:16:34.560 --> 00:16:40.140
Is yours better than mine?
I don't accept it!

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:43.080
I absolutely don't accept it!

00:17:12.400 --> 00:17:13.360
What's...?

00:17:13.900 --> 00:17:17.480
Her body can't take
the Ultranate any longer.

00:17:17.480 --> 00:17:20.060
Normally, the fusion of
Ultranate and a human is...

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:21.890
...extremely dangerous.

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:25.410
No matter how strong a
mind or body they may have...

00:17:25.410 --> 00:17:30.190
...a sudden fusion will
always destroy the human host.

00:17:30.530 --> 00:17:32.190
Help me, Big Brother!

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:33.110
Can't we do anything for her?

00:17:36.020 --> 00:17:39.780
Unfortunately, it's too late.
There's nothing we can do.

00:17:42.220 --> 00:17:44.080
That is so gross!

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:46.130
Rion, let's go.

00:17:46.130 --> 00:17:47.710
Yeah, right!

00:17:57.640 --> 00:17:59.930
Rion... Rion!

00:18:00.540 --> 00:18:06.740
Ah, so you can already
repel the force of this gun.

00:18:06.740 --> 00:18:11.330
The adaptability of Ultranate
metal is greater than I expected.

00:18:12.180 --> 00:18:14.440
Ultranate metal...

00:18:15.180 --> 00:18:19.370
Before the Great Disaster,
researchers were working on...

00:18:19.370 --> 00:18:23.580
...a fluid metal life form
to enhance physical strength.

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:27.210
Normally, it could have the
form of a piece of clothing.

00:18:27.210 --> 00:18:31.920
When activated, it would then spread over the body to a thickness only a few microns...

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:38.130
...to provide armor protection,
speed, and strength magnification.

00:18:38.130 --> 00:18:41.010
If it had been successful,
it would have been...

00:18:41.010 --> 00:18:44.320
...a new era in the
art of weapons design.

00:18:46.060 --> 00:18:49.730
But its development
was very difficult.

00:18:50.540 --> 00:18:53.660
Most researchers
lost their lives...

00:18:53.660 --> 00:18:56.530
...and the project was
thought to be a failure.

00:19:00.440 --> 00:19:04.610
There were reports of a single
success with a young girl.

00:19:04.610 --> 00:19:08.380
Unfortunately, it was thought
that she and the data on her...

00:19:08.380 --> 00:19:12.040
...were lost after
the disaster occurred.

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:18.510
That young girl, Miss Aika...
It was you, wasn't it?

00:19:20.570 --> 00:19:24.730
Unfortunately, I won't be
able to use Nena anymore.

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:31.130
So, now, Miss Aika, l'll make
you work for me in her place!

00:19:57.410 --> 00:19:59.550
You still have that
much strength left?

00:20:00.360 --> 00:20:03.220
For Aika's sake,
you must be destroyed!

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:10.890
No! Stop it! Stop!

00:20:13.130 --> 00:20:15.980
I'm still so immature at heart...

00:20:26.100 --> 00:20:27.790
Lagu resonance, confirmed.

00:20:28.100 --> 00:20:31.000
Mr. Hargen, we've
confirmed Lagu resonance.

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:35.960
Understood. I'll be
back in a little while.

00:20:37.700 --> 00:20:42.700
Miss Aika, this time
l'll make you mine.

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:54.730
An explosion?!

00:21:00.140 --> 00:21:03.400
We had explosions on the antenna
joint and several other in the ship!

00:21:03.400 --> 00:21:04.280
It's sabotage!

00:21:09.850 --> 00:21:11.700
Hurry! This way!

00:21:13.700 --> 00:21:14.460
Now what?!

00:21:20.070 --> 00:21:22.540
I've got you, Big Brother.

00:21:22.540 --> 00:21:24.430
N-Nena...

00:21:26.040 --> 00:21:30.060
Now you'll be
mine and mine alone.

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:32.270
Let me go, Nena!

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:36.080
Oh, no.
I'll never let you go.

00:21:36.500 --> 00:21:37.900
Let me go, Nena!

00:21:38.200 --> 00:21:43.110
No, no! lf I do, you'll
just run off somewhere!

00:21:43.110 --> 00:21:44.860
I won't do it!

00:21:44.860 --> 00:21:48.830
D-Don't be silly!
I won't go anywhere.

00:21:48.830 --> 00:21:51.290
I'm always there by
your side, aren't l?

00:21:51.290 --> 00:21:57.380
Liar. Oh, Big Brother,
now you can always care for me.

00:21:57.380 --> 00:21:59.290
Always love me.

00:22:00.900 --> 00:22:05.860
Because, you see, I love
you more than anything!

00:22:06.700 --> 00:22:10.220
No! Stop it!
Please, Nena, stop!

00:22:12.420 --> 00:22:15.640
The Lagu energy is reversing!
The main cable has burned through!

00:22:15.640 --> 00:22:18.240
Close all connections
to the Lagu reactor!

00:22:18.240 --> 00:22:19.930
Switch back to
standard power!

00:22:19.930 --> 00:22:22.290
Locking out all reactor
connection circuits.

00:22:22.290 --> 00:22:24.650
It's no use!
I can't lock them out!

00:22:24.650 --> 00:22:26.990
The energy in the
reactor is backflowing!

00:22:27.860 --> 00:22:32.200
What's wrong? You don't care
for me anymore, Big Brother?

00:22:33.100 --> 00:22:36.080
Aren't you supposed to
love your little sister?

00:22:36.080 --> 00:22:39.580
Rion! Rion!

00:22:39.840 --> 00:22:41.440
We've lost the transmitters!

00:22:44.000 --> 00:22:49.720
No! I won't do it!
Big Brother is mine!

00:22:51.420 --> 00:22:57.100
I won't...
I won't give him to anyone!

00:23:11.840 --> 00:23:13.120
Aika!

00:23:15.060 --> 00:23:16.700
Back on active duty, sir?

00:23:17.100 --> 00:23:20.710
Yeah, I am!
Somebody forced me into it!

00:23:25.440 --> 00:23:30.890
Big Brother... Big Brother...

00:23:31.110 --> 00:23:33.800
Mr. Hargen!
Mr. Hargen, please respond!

00:23:33.800 --> 00:23:36.380
It's no use! There's no
response from Mr. Hargen!

00:23:36.380 --> 00:23:38.970
Captain, the Lagu reactor
is out of control!

00:23:38.970 --> 00:23:40.810
It'll destroy the ship!

00:23:45.920 --> 00:23:48.280
Lagu resonance has
been completely lost.

00:23:48.280 --> 00:23:49.930
The operation has failed.

00:23:49.930 --> 00:23:50.450
Captain...

00:23:52.760 --> 00:23:55.130
All hands, abandon ship!

00:23:55.130 --> 00:23:55.660
Aye!

00:23:58.290 --> 00:24:00.750
Hurry! Get to
the escape capsules!

00:24:00.970 --> 00:24:03.500
Get going! You can still run!

00:24:03.500 --> 00:24:04.000
Right!

00:24:04.610 --> 00:24:07.180
All gunnery personnel
have evacuated!

00:24:07.180 --> 00:24:08.900
Captain!

00:24:08.900 --> 00:24:10.260
Let's go.

00:24:17.500 --> 00:24:21.370
What are you waiting for?!
Come on, this is a short cut!

00:24:21.750 --> 00:24:24.650
I'm running as fast
as I can, you know!

00:24:25.140 --> 00:24:28.360
What does Rion eat
to make her so heavy?!

00:24:29.860 --> 00:24:31.320
You just don't get
enough exercise, sir.

00:24:31.320 --> 00:24:32.440
You say something, Aika?!

00:24:32.440 --> 00:24:33.160
Nothing, sir.

00:24:34.060 --> 00:24:37.210
Are you guys all right?
We were getting tired of waiting!

00:24:37.210 --> 00:24:40.180
Oh, my sweet honey!

00:24:40.180 --> 00:24:41.490
Gusto! You're alive?

00:24:41.490 --> 00:24:43.170
We're outta here!

00:25:26.240 --> 00:25:27.540
Huh?

00:26:05.830 --> 00:26:09.920
Let's go out into the bustling city.

00:26:12.510 --> 00:26:20.260
I just want to slip off my boots and walk along with the wind.

00:26:21.470 --> 00:26:25.640
That feeling of honesty that I had forgotten...

00:26:28.020 --> 00:26:36.200
...is reawakened with just a single deep breath.

00:26:37.110 --> 00:26:41.080
As I sit by the window in the moonlight...

00:26:41.080 --> 00:26:45.960
...with my chin cupped in my hand...

00:26:45.960 --> 00:26:51.500
...I find myself thinking of you.

00:26:51.500 --> 00:27:00.140
Though I have kept it in my
heart for such a... such a long time...

00:27:00.140 --> 00:27:07.270
...without thinking, I look back at the person I used to be.

00:27:07.270 --> 00:27:15.190
I know, oh, I know.
It's because I'm much more naive than I look.

00:27:15.690 --> 00:27:25.660
Always wavering,
caught somewhere between cowardice and arrogance.

00:27:38.510 --> 00:27:47.020
Since those feelings are
growing stronger and stronger inside...

00:27:47.020 --> 00:27:54.190
...I gradually feel that there's a new tomorrow for me.

00:27:54.190 --> 00:27:58.610
Though I may hesitate, though I may dream...

00:27:58.610 --> 00:28:02.740
Though I may keep taking the long way around...

00:28:02.740 --> 00:28:06.660
...when I eventually reach that place...

00:28:06.660 --> 00:28:12.790
...I want to be met by your smiling face.
